{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disappear From Polizia DEMO</strong> is a streamlined taste of the world\u2019s only roguelike police checkpoint simulator, where you sneak bizarre contraband past cops who are even stranger than the cargo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039720/extras/7c5c25337dfb75465d5f15e0f9fa5344.poster.avif?t=1758792577\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039720/extras/7c5c25337dfb75465d5f15e0f9fa5344.webm?t=1758792577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039720/extras/7c5c25337dfb75465d5f15e0f9fa5344.mp4?t=1758792577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rescue Your Granny</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack up enough cash to cover the ransom and bring your dear nonna back home in one piece.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039720/extras/02f67523ced1b71d47d0cefcaecd265f.poster.avif?t=1758792577\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039720/extras/02f67523ced1b71d47d0cefcaecd265f.webm?t=1758792577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039720/extras/02f67523ced1b71d47d0cefcaecd265f.mp4?t=1758792577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep an Eye on Suspicion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every answer you give is evaluated instantly: if it feels off, inconsistent, or just too odd, the Suspicion bar climbs. Fill it up\u2014and it\u2019s straight to jail.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039720/extras/6933a16d3fb0183f0347c251ecdd6b6b.poster.avif?t=1758792577\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039720/extras/6933a16d3fb0183f0347c251ecdd6b6b.webm?t=1758792577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039720/extras/6933a16d3fb0183f0347c251ecdd6b6b.mp4?t=1758792577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Haul Outrageous Cargo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on wild delivery gigs that skyrocket your profits and invest in twisted tools that tilt the rules in your favor, helping you keep suspicion low.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039720/extras/7192f24468142a30d4eec13195c820b5.poster.avif?t=1758792577\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039720/extras/7192f24468142a30d4eec13195c820b5.webm?t=1758792577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039720/extras/7192f24468142a30d4eec13195c820b5.mp4?t=1758792577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THIS DEMO INCLUDES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A guided tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 memorable, atmospheric maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 distinct cops, each with their own quirks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI-driven conversational gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039720/extras/03e1d74fdff0cb928c62da9f93899408.poster.avif?t=1758792577\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039720/extras/03e1d74fdff0cb928c62da9f93899408.webm?t=1758792577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039720/extras/03e1d74fdff0cb928c62da9f93899408.mp4?t=1758792577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AI FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The LLM creates unique officer personalities and dynamic dialogue at every checkpoint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your responses are parsed and used to adjust the Suspicion meter in real time.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039720?t=1758792577","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039720/6c2034826ab8b355ae23b77cba2df637bff20715/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758792577","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039720/4f286d32515b940c59fd23dd9b05be0ea9bd96d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758792577","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039720/4f286d32515b940c59fd23dd9b05be0ea9bd96d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758792577","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disappear From Polizia DEMO</strong> is a streamlined taste of the world\u2019s only roguelike police checkpoint simulator, where you sneak bizarre contraband past cops who are even stranger than the cargo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay